sequenceDiagram
    participant Customer as 顾客
    participant App as 购物应用
    participant Product as 商品服务
    participant Order as 订单系统
    participant Payment as 支付系统
    participant Warehouse as 仓库
    participant Delivery as 快递

    Customer->>App: 浏览商品
    App->>Product: 查询商品
    Product->>App: 返回商品列表
    App->>Customer: 显示商品

    Customer->>App: 选择商品加入购物车
    App->>App: 更新购物车

    Customer->>App: 下单
    activate App
    App->>Order: 创建订单
    activate Order
    Order->>Product: 检查库存
    Product->>Order: 库存充足
    Order->>App: 订单创建成功
    deactivate Order
    App->>Customer: 确认订单

    Customer->>App: 立即支付
    App->>Payment: 发起支付请求
    activate Payment

    alt 支付成功
        Payment->>Order: 确认支付
        Order->>Warehouse: 打包商品
        activate Warehouse
        Warehouse->>Delivery: 交付快递
        deactivate Warehouse
        Delivery->>Customer: 发货通知
        Customer->>Order: 确认收货
        Order->>Customer: 订单完成
    else 支付失败
        Payment->>Customer: 支付失败
        Payment->>Order: 取消订单
    end

    deactivate Payment
    deactivate App

    Customer->>App: 查看订单
    App->>Order: 查询订单详情
    Order->>App: 返回订单信息
    App->>Customer: 显示订单状态
